# Style profile: flat 2D cartoon. Select with STYLE_PROFILE=cartoon or `shorts --style cartoon`.
STYLE_PROMPT=flat 2D cartoon illustration, bold clean black outlines, cel shading, bright saturated colors, simple shapes, vertical composition
NEGATIVE_PROMPT=text, letters, speech bubble, watermark, logo, signature, photo, photorealistic, 3d render, blurry, lowres, deformed
STYLE_GUIDE=Simple, readable cartoon shapes, friendly expressive characters and creatures, bright backgrounds with a few clear details. Keep real objects recognizable (correct basic shape of spacecraft, animals, landmarks).
MOTION_I2V_PROMPT_SUFFIX=2D cartoon animation, flat colors stay clean
CAPTION_FONT=Luckiest Guy
CAPTION_COLOR=#FFFFFF
